'''The Devils Strike!''' (悪魔軍 強襲！''Akuma-gun Kyōshū!'') is one of two [[Bikkuriman Collaboration Event|Bikkuriman Collaboration]] [[Gauntlet]]s added in the [[Version 9.7 Update]]. [[Beastly Nero (Enemy)|Beastly Nero]], [[Super Devil (Uber Rare Cat)|Super Devil]] and [[Satanmaria (Enemy)|Satanmaria]] are the main enemies in this Gauntlet.

==Overview==
===About===
The Devils Strike! contains a total of 20 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Nether Reaches Lvs.''' (天魔界 Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Nether Reaches Lv. can include XP, [[Battle Items]], [[Cat Capsule|Tickets]] (Rare and Bikkuriman) and [[Cat Energy|Leaderships]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[The Devils Strike!/Nether Reaches Lv.1~20]].''

==Play Requirements==
*The Devils Strike! is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats|Japan]] Chapter 1.

